{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>For with a strong hand</b> — Mine — <b>He shall send them</b>, and not <b>with a strong hand</b> — his — drive them out; and not as he would have been appeased to let them go for a three-day journey to slaughter and then return afterward to his service. And so it says: 'when he sends them — utterly he shall drive them out'; and it says: 'and Egypt strengthened itself against the people.' <b>The sedra of Parashat Shemot is completed.</b>"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:56:17.561599474Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}